e703-4d41-b417-5baedf1f9d64" facs="#m-0643405f-6622-4b7a-9b79-49726ae354ea" label="lyrics-like">Ll sancto Ignátio grátias agéntes tercessióne, perdúcat. Pér Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2c6517e-168c-442f-aaba-599ae6588159" facs="#m-5f4606cb-bada-4ee0-9d13-98c91c0aa8b8" label="lyrics-like">obtúlimus: ad perpétuam nos ma-l num.</l><l xml:id="m-8d98c30c-744a-490a-aecd-744a38e59f6c" facs="#m-d8e03c9d-1e82-4356-84ec-880aff370ef2" label="ambiguous">  e   c c   e d</l><l xml:id="m-b5a5fdeb-4fe7-452c-9aac-2b2760eee662" facs="#m-7451ca8d-4ea6-477c-bcdb-490cad483e1c" label="text-like">FEASTS OF AUGUST.</l><l xml:id="m-290dca97-0b09-4a08-a00c-21b3ff54c502" facs="#m-ebedff93-a8f7-4be6-8b24-e2eaa067e499" label="ambiguous">St. Peter’s Chains.</l><l xml:id="m-38d3ad15-ec36-406f-87d7-90fd82652418" facs="#m-fd9cecbd-1fea-41e3-97c4-eeda5e55be95" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-3db38349-7231-4455-a62f-9538a884ab4b" facs="#m-946f5e3b-c2c9-4365-92c5-66aef9c9029d" label="ambiguous">Double major.</l><l xml:id="m-13d9e588-20d4-46a7-9541-3955f5a2b2a4" facs="#m-cb015333-18b5-45df-b258-39866ed04b41" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-06f46df2-69f0-4e5b-b969-b75009fbcec6" facs="#m-efe62b44-3ffb-4078-bd4e-c9c8af9617a0" label="text-like">The Psalms are indicated at the beginning of second Vespers, p. 1577.</l><l xml:id="m-0edbf37c-cf21-4c60-86d5-13a3c7ad999b" facs="#m-7c5e9883-b4da-4c52-aeb7-0e145d7e90a7" label="text-like">Antiphons, Chapter, Hymn, and Y. of second Vespers. 1577.</l><l xml:id="m-593d93d3-94e9-433f-9216-43348204eb3d" facs="#m-29957464-5d39-411d-9a6e-c7209f71660b" label="lyrics-like">At Magn. Ant. Tu es pástor. p. 1516. — Prayer. Deus, qui beátum</l><l xml:id="m-7d3b5ce6-5b05-4c83-ac9f-4c666aa75325" facs="#m-4311093e-f851-482a-96fa-8b8b97ab15e5" label="ambiguous">Petrum. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-69b472a4-5058-4ddc-a79a-e713ec25ad94" facs="#m-03a2cd52-894e-464d-87d1-a50bb1cb78d7" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of St. Paul. Ant. Sáncte Pá̂ule. p. 1350. Y. Tu es vas.</l><l xml:id="m-e4002db2-ffbc-4e5c-b737-e66b9700c59a" facs="#m-fff35d4c-7187-4cd4-8566-88c34e914e15" label="lyrics-like">— Prayer. Deus qui multitúdinem. p. 1381.</l><l xml:id="m-4d069037-7352-4972-b4b4-674539170327" facs="#m-73254f2c-8754-45c8-b8c9-3d48b8e6c545" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Holy Machabees, Martyrs. Ant. Istórum est.</l><l xml:id="m-8a95d8c6-c7f0-45b1-bba6-5561e17ca386" facs="#m-f2d0c3da-160c-4519-b8b6-be0f344d0d33" label="lyrics-like">p. 262a. Y. Lactámini.</l><l xml:id="m-8c514152-178b-4472-94f0-36e08e497830" facs="#m-7fdd0bb5-9b5d-4b83-a607-cab59c3d0743" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Fratérna nos. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-d956e7c5-735e-49ef-8b5e-814d3ddda584" facs="#m-0ecbc36b-2b18-4807-85d2-a0f8d1914b2b" label="text-like">At the Little Hours. Antiphons of Vespers, p. 1577. Chapters, Short</l><l xml:id="m-f733b2bb-8e91-4cf9-8863-c9a7988466d2" facs="#m-7880b817-bc03-4d9f-bba9-52489a8b0fe0" label="text-like">Responsories, and Versicles as on the Feast of SS. Peter and Paul, p. 1518.</l><l xml:id="m-62251a1a-154e-4e41-87cf-60174d5f2654" facs="#m-88c92c43-9f66-4d9a-9f94-6cbc23ca2fb4" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui beátum Petrum. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-1470047a-329a-4e03-b16e-5ed8149cfd46" facs="#m-7c5d30c5-0efc-40b6-bf8c-fcd75702d4a9" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-832d683e-4c5f-4198-810c-db7fcf7c6b0a" facs="#m-40bc8833-08a1-4210-b086-6df53a1bd00c" label="text-like">As on the Feast of SS. Peter and Paul, p. 1518, except the followins:</l><l xml:id="m-110cfc6b-2388-4e52-a228-6022fe53f321" facs="#m-5ea09d92-5464-4e33-bba7-cac6eee09ab5" label="ambiguous">Collect¬</l><l xml:id="m-94563d7c-a1e5-4d2d-aad1-44e4bd0117c0" facs="#m-d1a0453b-a8fe-4244-96af-684ec4631d83" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Petrum Apó-] quaésumus, absólve víncula pecca¬</l><l xml:id="m-33d58416-1d3d-4827-bc80-6e36a01c45d6" facs="#m-367580ee-63d4-462f-b168-eed31488d6f6" label="lyrics-like">I stolum, a vínculis absolútum, tórum;“ et ómnia mala a nobis</l><l xml:id="m-c9b80d60-f6ff-4f7a-8801-39c73d28b9ac" facs="#m-cf30a66d-08cc-4c36-b0c9-b4c5c8a456be" label="lyrics-like">illaésum abire fecisti :t nostrórum, l propitiátus exclúde. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c5a91a20-3a83-45be-8625-03ef915990ed" facs="#m-a1f0f2f1-ff65-4400-aec2-3947c13e38ae" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of St. Paul. Collect. Deus qui multitúdinem. p. 1831.</l><l xml:id="m-ef49e1e6-0390-43ed-b741-d07b5408cf58" facs="#m-8b6543b0-c4b4-4882-be51-6eb2a61e149b" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Holy Machabees, Martyrs. Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7c340f5a-a9d0-4cf5-af62-82556ba2e93c" facs="#m-63abf82a-70af-411e-886b-df6681738561" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratérna nos Dómine Mártyrum! creménta virtútum, et multíplici</l><l xml:id="m-a2ddd6b1-c5e0-4156-ba03-c47ddb1e6999" facs="#m-5986b10c-7ab7-446b-997d-009e30d041c8" label="lyrics-like">nos suffrágio consolétur. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c69ce88-4a66-47b8-bfcb-2f5c324c1259" facs="#m-500429be-a820-47a4-9491-ccd7a39b0e5d" label="lyrics-like">tuórum coróna laetificet:</l><l xml:id="m-1fa7da66-eb54-44fb-8646-f792bbcec0a5" facs="#m-075fee57-bd5f-4739-8832-001bcd5f0476" label="lyrics-like">quae et fidei nostrae praébeat in-]minum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
